USER MANUAL


Step 1: Setup Path

-	Go to the downloaded ZIP folder and unzip the files. Then, locate the subfolder named Application inside the Airbnb Interactive System folder.

-	Open the command prompt from this location. 


Step 2:  Download Required Libraries

-	You can install all required modules using the ‘’requirements.txt’’ file.

-	Use the below command to install all the required modules.
pip install -r requirements. txt


Step 3: Run the Application

-	One the installation is done, run the below command to run the application.

python app.py


Step 4: Launch the Interactive System

Follow the link shown in the command prompt or type the below address in your web browser to launch the system.

http://127.0.0.1:8050/
